# Dynamic element read without a prior write keeps its subtype

Verifies a dynamic indexed read of a mixed-subtype array keeps the stored
subtype, so `10mm` plus `2dm` is converted to the millimeter scale and yields
`210mm`.

>>> source
let sizes: int[] = [10mm, 2cm]
let index = 0
print(sizes[index] + 2dm)

<<< stdout
210mm

<<< stderr
